Throwaway probes, not part of the build and not linked into CKERMIT.EXE.

  vwild.c   Open Watcom.  Asks MS-DOS 3.1 directly what it does with ".",
            with trailing separators, with FindFirst and with opendir, in
            the root directory and in a subdirectory.
  vmatch.c  ia16-elf-gcc, linked against the port's own ckclib.o.  Asks
            ckmatch() and libdos-m's stat() the exact questions the
            wildcard path depends on.

Both exist because reasoning about these answers went wrong twice.  See
PORTING.md SS16f.  Build lines are in the comment at the top of each file;
neither is built by victor9k.mak or victorow.mak.
